# Git push policy

- Do **not** run `git push`, `gh-pages` deploy, or any remote publish after making code changes.
- Only push or deploy when the user **explicitly** asks in that message (e.g. "push", "upload to github", "deploy").
- Local commits are also only when the user asks to commit.
- Fixing code and verifying locally does not imply permission to push.
